  "privacyCollectedHeading": "What data is collected",
  "privacyCollectedBody": "We collect account information (name, email, role) and operational data needed to run the scheduling system (patient records, surgery schedules, room and staff assignments). All data stays within the hospital's own private backend and is never stored on third-party servers.",
  "privacyUsageHeading": "How data is used",
  "privacyUsageBody": "Data is used solely to operate and coordinate operating-room scheduling within the hospital — assigning rooms, tracking surgery status, and notifying relevant staff.",
  "privacySharingHeading": "Sharing",
  "privacySharingBody": "Data is not shared with any third party. It is only accessible to authorized hospital staff through this application.",
  "privacyStorageHeading": "Storage & security",
  "privacyStorageBody": "Data is stored securely on the hospital's own server infrastructure, protected by authenticated access and role-based permissions.",
  "privacyContactHeading": "Contact",
  "privacyContactBody": "For privacy concerns, contact mohamed.alomari.dev@gmail.com.",

